              "text": "suspīrō, suspīrāre — \"to sigh\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Iuvenis suspīrat et dē puellā cōgitat. The young man sighs and thinks about the girl."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "suspīrō, suspīrāre, suspīrāvī, suspīrātum: sub 'up from below' + spīrō 'to breathe'."
            }
          ]
